sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web Server
    participant DB as Database
    U->>+W: GET /index.html
    W->>DB: SELECT * FROM pages
    DB-->>W: rows
    Note right of DB: cached for 60s
    loop Every minute
        W->>W: refresh cache
    end
    alt is logged in
        W-->>U: 200 OK
    else not logged in
        W--xU: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    W-)DB: async log
    Note over U,W: done
    W-->>-U: close
